### Short Story

Gnome Warlock Pipwick and his succubus, Velvet, trekked through Stranglethorn Vale, dodging panthers and pirates alike. While other warlocks favored the sturdy voidwalker, Pipwick loved Velvet’s Seduction. She’d whisper to a troll guard, and he’d stroll away, letting Pipwick loot the camp in peace. “See?” he grinned, “It’s not about brute force—it’s about charm.” Velvet purred, eyes gleaming. Together, they turned chaos into quiet profit.

### Answer

Because Succubus’s Seduction ability makes her more effective for solo questing by CC’ing enemies, allowing safer pulls and faster XP, so players perceive her as “better” despite the voidwalker’s tankiness. [end of text]


